so-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all;\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">6. </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">제출 및 문의처</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- 2022.7.18.(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">오전 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">12:00</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">까지</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">이메일 제출</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"word-break: keep-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\">      </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- SW인재양성</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">사업단 담당 이희영</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">☎ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;